# p-hover-box (h11-p-drag): P's 48 px hit box, measured from its centre
# (1028, 290): 23 px right is inside the box (the open hand, grab-hover),
# 25 px right is outside it (the pan cursor, and Q at the quantized x 2.50).
# The box's edge is at 24 px: 24 px right still hits (measured), 25 px does
# not. Two shots.
# Behaviour (read on ref-h11 at c6754e7, WebKit/Chromium/Firefox alike):
# shot 1 cursor grab-hover, no q line; shot 2 cursor pan, q 2.5.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 1029 291
wait 800
move 1051 290
wait 500
shot p-hover-box-inside
move 1053 290
wait 500
shot p-hover-box-outside
